    colors: 3-4 distinct (including outer color)
    corners: all four corners share the same outer_color
    structure: banded pattern of identical-row runs (axis 0) and identical-col runs (axis 1)
    row_runs: 1-5 distinct bands, col_runs: 3-7 distinct bands
    each run is a group of consecutive identical rows (or cols); run widths 1-5
    stretch_run: per axis, exactly one run has strictly more unique colors than all others (or if tied, is uniquely the widest); this is the stretchable interior band
